{
  "s02": {
    "duration": 29.952,
    "sentences": [
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "数据报到了主机，怎么知道该交给哪个程序？",
        "offset": 1000000,
        "duration": 39712266
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "靠目的端口。",
        "offset": 40212266,
        "duration": 15801887
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "这一步，叫分用。",
        "offset": 56014153,
        "duration": 19457548
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "IP 层把数据报交上来，传输层按目的端口，分给不同的应用进程。",
        "offset": 75471702,
        "duration": 62264154
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "端口五十三给 DNS，六十九给 TFTP，五百二十给 RIP。",
        "offset": 137735856,
        "duration": 57665097
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "如果目的端口上根本没有进程在等，这个报文会被直接丢掉。",
        "offset": 195400953,
        "duration": 52712266
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "同时，主机回一个 ICMP 差错报文：端口不可达。",
        "offset": 248113220,
        "duration": 50825474
      }
    ],
