  "s06": {
    "duration": 35.976,
    "sentences": [
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "接收端怎么验证？",
        "offset": 1000000,
        "duration": 18367925
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "方法简单得有点意外。",
        "offset": 18867925,
        "duration": 21816038
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "把收到的数据原样再算一遍，连校验和字段一起算。",
        "offset": 40683964,
        "duration": 45518870
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "如果数据没错，加起来的结果一定是全一。",
        "offset": 86202834,
        "duration": 40094341
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "不是全一，说明路上出了错。",
        "offset": 126297176,
        "duration": 28066039
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "UDP 通常直接丢弃，它不重传。",
        "offset": 154363215,
        "duration": 33844341
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "但丢弃不是唯一选择：也可以交给上层，附上一句这是错的数据。",
        "offset": 188207557,
        "duration": 60141512
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "还有两个特殊值要记牢：校验和全零，表示发送端根本没算。",
        "offset": 248349070,
        "duration": 54834908
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "而如果算出来的和恰好是零，就填全一，避免和禁用混淆。",
        "offset": 303183978,
        "duration": 55896229
      }
    ],
