  "s08": {
    "duration": 40.536,
    "sentences": [
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "这些特点听起来全是缺点，那它为什么还在用？",
        "offset": 1000000,
        "duration": 41245285
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "第一类，一次只传一点点数据：DNS、SNMP。",
        "offset": 41745285,
        "duration": 50707549
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "为了一次查询去握手三次、挥手四次，开销比数据本身还大。",
        "offset": 92452835,
        "duration": 57900946
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "第二类，对延迟敏感：视频会议、直播、游戏。",
        "offset": 150353781,
        "duration": 48466983
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "晚到的画面没有价值，宁可丢一帧，也不要卡住等重传。",
        "offset": 198820765,
        "duration": 49528304
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "第三类，应用自己实现可靠性：在 UDP 上面自己写确认和重传。",
        "offset": 248349070,
        "duration": 63915097
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "QUIC 就是这么干的，HTTP/3 就跑在 UDP 上。",
        "offset": 312264167,
        "duration": 45754719
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "所以 UDP 不是不可靠，它是把可靠性外包了出去。",
        "offset": 358018887,
        "duration": 46816040
      }
    ],
